@startuml
actor Searcher
participant Frontend
participant API
participant SearchService
database Database

Searcher -> Frontend: Enter query and filters
Frontend -> API: GET /reports?q=...&filters
API -> SearchService: Search approved reports
SearchService -> Database: Apply filters and text search
Database --> SearchService: Candidate reports
SearchService -> SearchService: Calculate relevance/similarity
SearchService --> API: Ranked safe result DTOs
API --> Frontend: Result cards and scores
Frontend --> Searcher: Display matching reports
@enduml
